#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:257
msgid ""
"There is no network connection available.\n"
"Please check your connection settings and try again"
msgstr ""
"Nema dostupne mrežne veze\n"
"Provjerite postavke i probajte ponovo."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:262
msgid ""
"The package list needs to be rebuilt.\n"
"This should have been done by the backend automatically."
msgstr ""
"Spisak paketa mora biti ponovno napravljen\n"
"Ovo je pozadinski sistem trebao automatski uraditi."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:267
msgid ""
"The service that is responsible for handling user requests is out of "
"memory.\n"
"Please close some programs or restart your computer."
msgstr ""
"Servisu koji je odgovoran za obradu zahtjeva korsinika nedostaje memorije.\n"
"Zatvorite neke programe ili ponovo pokrenite računar"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:272
msgid "A thread could not be created to service the user request."
msgstr "Aplikacija ne može biti napravljena da usluži zahtjev korisnika"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:276
msgid ""
"The action is not supported by this backend.\n"
"Please report a bug as this should not have happened."
msgstr ""
"Radnja nije podržana ovom aplikacijom.\n"
"Molimo prijavite grešku, jer se to nije trebalo dogoditi."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:281
msgid ""
"A problem that we were not expecting has occurred.\n"
"Please report this bug with the error description."
msgstr ""
"Pojavio se je neočekivani problem.\n"
"Molimo prijavite ovu grešku s njenim opisom."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:286
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A security trust relationship could not be made with the software origin.\n"
"Please check your software signature settings. %1"
msgstr ""
"Sigurna sigurnosna veza nije ostvarena sa softverom.\n"
"Molimo provjerite postavke softvera. %1"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:291
msgid ""
"The package that is trying to be removed or updated is not already installed."
msgstr "Paket koji pokušavate ukloniti ili ažurirati nije instaliran."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:295
msgid ""
"The package that is being modified was not found on your system or in any "
"software origin."
msgstr ""
"Paket koji je promijenjen nije pronađen u vašem sistemu ili u nekom od "
"softverskih izvora."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:299
msgid "The package that is trying to be installed is already installed."
msgstr "Paket koji pokušavate instalirati je već instaliran."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:307
msgid ""
"The group type was not found.\n"
"Please check your group list and try again."
msgstr ""
"Vrsta grupe nije pronađena.\n"
"Provjerite listu grupa i probajte ponovo."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:312
msgid ""
"The group list could not be loaded.\n"
"Refreshing your cache may help, although this is normally a software origin "
"error."
msgstr ""
"Grupni spisak se ne može učitati.\n"
"Osvježavanje keša može pomoći ako je to normalno softverska greška."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:322
msgid "The search filter was not correctly formed."
msgstr "Pretraživački filter nije pravilno formiran."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:326
msgid ""
"The package identifier was not well formed when sent to the system daemon.\n"
"This normally indicates an internal bug and should be reported."
msgstr ""
"Identifikator paketa nije dobro formiran kada je poslan u sistem.\n"
"To je obično interna greška koja treba biti javljena."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:335
msgid ""
"The remote software origin name was not found.\n"
"You may need to enable an item in Software Origins."
msgstr ""
"Porijeklo imena izdvojenog programa nije pronađeno.\n"
"Možda ćete morati omogućiti stavku u izvorima softvera."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:340
msgid "Removing a protected system package is not allowed."
msgstr "Uklanjanje zaštićenog sistemskog paketa nije dozvoljeno."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:347
msgid ""
"The task was canceled successfully and no packages were changed.\n"
"The backend did not exit cleanly."
msgstr ""
"Zadatak je uspješno otkazan i nijedan paket nije izmjenjen.\n"
"Pozadina nije čisto izašla."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:352
msgid ""
"The native package configuration file could not be opened.\n"
"Please make sure your system's configuration is valid."
msgstr ""
"Izvorna konfiguracija paketa datoteke ne može biti otvorena.\n"
"Provjerite ispravnost sistemske konfiguracije."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:358
msgid "The task is not safe to be canceled at this time."
msgstr "Zadatak nije sigurno otkazati u ovom momentu."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:362
msgid ""
"Source packages are not normally installed this way.\n"
"Check the extension of the file you are trying to install."
msgstr ""
"Izvorni paketi nisu normalno instalirani na ovaj način.\n"
"Provjerite ekstenziju datoteke koju pokušavate istalirati."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:367
msgid ""
"The license agreement was not agreed to.\n"
"To use this software you have to accept the license."
msgstr ""
"Licencni ugovor nije potvrđen.\n"
"Da biste koristili ovaj program morate prihvatiti licencu."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:376
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Multiple packages exist that are not compatible with each other.\n"
"This is usually due to mixing packages from different software origins. %1"
msgstr ""
"Više istovremenih izlaza iz paketa koji nisu kompatibilni jedan s drugim.\n"
"Ovo se obično javlja pri miješanju paketa različitih proizvođača softvera. %1"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:381
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"There was a (possibly temporary) problem connecting to a software origin.\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Javio se problem (vjerovatno privremeni) prilikom povezivanja sa softverom.\n"
"%1"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:386
msgid ""
"Failed to initialize packaging backend.\n"
"This may occur if other packaging tools are being used simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"Nije uspio početak paketskog pozadinskog sistema.\n"
"To se dešava ako se drugi paketski alati istovremeno koriste."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:394
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Cannot get the exclusive lock on the packaging backend.\n"
"Please close any other packaging tools that may be open. %1"
msgstr ""
"Ne mogu dobiti ekskluzivnu bravu na pozadinski sistem paketa.\n"
"Zatvorite sve ostale alate koje rade sa paketima. %1"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:399
msgid "None of the selected packages could be updated."
msgstr "Nijedan od izabranih paketa ne može biti ažuriran."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:403
msgid "The repository configuration could not be modified."
msgstr "Konfiguracija skladišta se ne može mijenjati"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:407
#, kde-format
msgid "Installing the local file failed. %1"
msgstr "Instalacija lokalne datoteke nije uspjela. %1"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:412
msgid "The package signature could not be verified."
msgstr "Paketski potpis ne može biti ovjeren."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:416
msgid ""
"The package signature was missing and this package is untrusted.\n"
"This package was not signed with a GPG key when created."
msgstr ""
"Nedostaje paketski potpis i ovaj paket je nesiguran.\n"
"Ovaj paket nije potpisan sa GPG ključem prilikom njegovog kreiranja."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:420
msgid "Repository configuration was invalid and could not be read."
msgstr "Konfiguracija skladišta je nevažeća i nije čitljiva."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:424
msgid ""
"The package you are attempting to install is not valid.\n"
"The package file could be corrupt, or not a proper package."
msgstr ""
"Paket koji pokušavate instalirati nije važeći.\n"
"Paketska datoteka je možda oštećena ili nije ispravan paket."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:429
msgid ""
"Installation of this package was prevented by your packaging system's "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"Instalacija ovog paketa je spriječena od strane vaše sistemske konfiguracije."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:433
msgid ""
"The package that was downloaded is corrupt and needs to be downloaded again."
msgstr "Preuzeti paket je oštećen i potrebno ga je ponovno preuzeti."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:437
msgid ""
"All of the packages selected for install are already installed on the system."
msgstr "Svi odabrani paketi za instalaciju su već instalirani na sistemu."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:441
msgid ""
"The specified file could not be found on the system.\n"
"Check that the file still exists and has not been deleted."
msgstr ""
"Određena datoteka nije pronađena u sistemu.\n"
"Provjerite da li datoteka još postoji i da nije obrisana."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:446
msgid ""
"Required data could not be found on any of the configured software origins.\n"
"There were no more download mirrors that could be tried."
msgstr ""
"Traženi podaci nisu pronađeni na bilo kojem konfigurisanom programskom "
"izvoru.\n"
"Nema ogledala za preuzimanje koja mogu biti isprobana."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:451
msgid ""
"Required upgrade data could not be found in any of the configured software "
"origins.\n"
"The list of distribution upgrades will be unavailable."
msgstr ""
"Tražena nadgradnja podataka nije pronađena na bilo kojem konfigurisanom "
"programskom izvoru.\n"
"Lista distribucijskih nadogradnji nije raspoloživa."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:456
msgid ""
"The package that is trying to be installed is incompatible with this system."
msgstr "Paket koji pokušavate instalirati nije kompatibilan sa ovim sistemom."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:460
msgid ""
"There is insufficient space on the device.\n"
"Free some space on the system disk to perform this operation."
msgstr ""
"Nema dovoljno prostora na uređaju.\n"
"Oslobodite prostor na sistemskom disku da obavite operaciju."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:465
msgid "Additional media are required to complete the transaction."
msgstr "Dodatni mediji su potrebni da se završi transakcija."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:469
msgid ""
"You have failed to provide correct authentication.\n"
"Please check any passwords or account settings."
msgstr ""
"Niste uspjeli pružiti valjanu ovjeru.\n"
"Provjerite postavke lozinki i naloga."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:474
msgid ""
"The specified update could not be found.\n"
"It could have already been installed or no longer available on the remote "
"server."
msgstr ""
"Naznačena nadgradnja nije pronađena.\n"
"Možda je već instaliran ili nije više dostupan na udaljenom serveru."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:479
msgid "The package could not be installed from untrusted origin."
msgstr "Paket ne može biti instaliran iz nesigurnog izvora."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:483
msgid "The package could not be updated from untrusted origin."
msgstr "Paket ne može biti ažuriran iz nesigurnog izvora."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:491
msgid "The specified software origin could not be disabled."
msgstr "Određeni programski izvor se ne može onemogućiti."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:495
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The download could not be done automatically and should be done manually. %1"
msgstr ""
"Preuzimanje se ne može odraditi automatski, i treba biti odrađeno ručno. %1"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:499
#, kde-format
msgid "One of the selected packages failed to configure correctly. %1"
msgstr "Jedan od selektiranih paketa nije uspješno konfigurisan. %1"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:504
#, kde-format
msgid "One of the selected packages failed to build correctly. %1"
msgstr "Jedan od selektiranih paketa nije uspješno izgrađen. %1"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:509
#, kde-format
msgid "One of the selected packages failed to install correctly. %1"
msgstr "Jedan od selektiranih paketa nije uspješno instaliran. %1"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:514
#, kde-format
msgid "One of the selected packages failed to be removed correctly. %1"
msgstr "Jedan od selektiranih paketa nije uspješno uklonjen. %1"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:518
#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:522
msgid "Unknown error, more information available in the detailed report."
msgstr "Nepoznata greška, više informacija je dostupno u detaljnom izvještaju."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:533
msgid "A mirror is possibly broken"
msgstr "Ogledalo je vjerovatno pokvareno"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:536
msgid "The connection was refused"
msgstr "Veza je odbijena"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:539
msgid "The parameter was invalid"
msgstr "Parametar je bio nevažeći"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:542
msgid "The priority was invalid"
msgstr "Prioritet je bio nevažeći"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:545
msgid "Backend warning"
msgstr "Upozorenje pozadinskog sistema"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:548
msgid "Daemon warning"
msgstr "Daemon upozorenje"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:551
msgid "The package list cache is being rebuilt"
msgstr "Keš lista paketa je obnovljena"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:554
msgid "An untrusted package was installed"
msgstr "Instaliran je nesiguran paket"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:557
msgid "A newer package exists"
msgstr "Postoji noviji paket"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:560
msgid "Could not find package"
msgstr "Nije pronađen paket"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:563
msgid "Configuration files were changed"
msgstr "Konfiguracijske datoteke su promjenjene"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:566
msgid "Package is already installed"
msgstr "Paket je već instaliran"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:569
msgid "Automatic cleanup is being ignored"
msgstr "Automatsko čišćenje je ignorisano"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:572
msgid "Software source download failed"
msgstr "Preuzimanje programskog izvora nije uspjelo"

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:585
msgid "You do not have the necessary privileges to perform this action."
msgstr "Nemate potrebne privilegije da izvršite ovu radnju."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:588
msgid "Could not get a transaction id from packagekitd."
msgstr "Ne može se dobiti transakcijski id iz paketa."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:591
msgid "Cannot connect to this transaction id."
msgstr "Ne može da se poveže na ovaj transakcijski id."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:594
msgid "This action is unknown."
msgstr "Ova radnja je nepoznata."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:597
msgid "The packagekitd service could not be started."
msgstr "Packagekitd usluga ne može biti pokrenuta."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:600
msgid "The query is not valid."
msgstr "Upit je nevažeći."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:603
msgid "The file is not valid."
msgstr "Datoteka je nevažeća."

#: backends/packagekit/PKStringsAndIcons.h:606
